# Screen-reader announcements CSV

Canonical file: `docs/screen-reader-announcements.csv`

When you add, change, or remove any of these in renderer code, update that CSV in the **same change**:

- `aria-label` / `aria-labelledby` / `aria-describedby`
- `announce(...)` live-region strings
- `alt` text that is spoken
- dialog / region titles (`role="dialog"` labels, `id` headings)

Do **not** invent copy. Match the string in code.

CSV columns: `type, location, Trigger, Scenario, Message, source_file, line, politeness, Notes`

- `type`: `aria-label`, `live-announce`, `dialog-title`, `aria-describedby`, `helper-fn`, `data-field`
- `location`: component or module name
- `line`: the current source line (best effort)
- `politeness`: `assertive`, `polite`, or `n/a` for labels
- Do not rename visitor-facing labels (keep Transcript, Zoom, etc.) unless the product change is explicitly a rename
